---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About OllaNode — Self-Hosted Video Infrastructure & CDN"
  description="OllaNode is a self-hosted, API-first video, CDN, storage, and edge platform written in Rust. Learn about our architecture, capabilities, and ownership-first pricing."
>
  <div class="wai-about-wrapper">
    <!-- 1. Breadcrumb Bar -->
    <nav class="wai-breadcrumb-bar" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <div class="container-wide">
        <ol class="breadcrumb-list">
          <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
          <li class="separator" aria-hidden="true">/</li>
          <li aria-current="page"><span>About OllaNode</span></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- 2. Main Two-Column Layout -->
    <div class="container-wide wai-layout-grid">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Sticky Sidenav (Desktop) / Horizontal Strip (Mobile) -->
      <aside class="wai-sidenav-col" aria-label="Secondary navigation">
        <nav class="wai-sidenav-sticky">
          <div class="sidenav-header">
            <span class="sidenav-title">About OllaNode</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="sidenav-menu">
            <li><a href="#overview" class="sidenav-link active">Overview</a></li>
            <li><a href="#brief" class="sidenav-link">Brief</a></li>
            <li><a href="#architecture" class="sidenav-link">Architecture</a></li>
            <li><a href="#capabilities" class="sidenav-link">Surfaces</a></li>
            <li><a href="#pricing" class="sidenav-link">Pricing</a></li>
            <li><a href="#faq" class="sidenav-link">FAQ</a></li>
          </ul>

          <div class="sidenav-cta-box">
            <div class="cta-box-title">Self-Host OllaNode</div>
            <p class="cta-box-desc">Apache-2.0 license. Zero per-minute fees.</p>
            <a href="https://login.ollanode.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="sidenav-cta-btn">
              Start Free →
            </a>
          </div>
        </nav>
      </aside>

      <!-- Main Content Column -->
      <main class="wai-main-col" id="main-content">
        
        <!-- Header -->
        <header class="wai-page-header" id="overview">
          <div class="header-eyebrow mono">API-FIRST VIDEO PLATFORM</div>
          <h1 class="wai-page-title">About OllaNode</h1>
        </header>

        <!-- Mission Callout Box -->
        <aside class="wai-box wai-box-mission" aria-label="Platform Mission">
          <div class="wai-box-inner">
            <p class="mission-text">
              <strong>One unified REST API for video, CDN, storage, and edge compute — without per-minute billing.</strong>
            </p>
            <p class="mission-subtext">
              Upload, transcode, stream, and deliver video on your own infrastructure. Mux and Cloudflare Stream-class performance with full hardware ownership.
            </p>
          </div>
        </aside>

        <!-- Brief Box: What OllaNode Delivers vs Eliminates -->
        <section class="wai-box wai-box-full" id="brief" aria-label="Platform Brief">
          <div class="wai-box-header">
            <h2 class="wai-box-h2">Platform Brief</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="wai-box-inner">
            <div class="brief-columns">
              <div class="brief-column">
                <h3 class="brief-col-heading">OllaNode delivers…</h3>
                <ul class="brief-checklist">
                  <li><strong>Video pipeline:</strong> Dynamic HLS ladders (360p→4K), thumbnail sprites & Whisper transcripts.</li>
                  <li><strong>Edge CDN & storage:</strong> Multi-tenant pull zones on OpenResty edge, S3 storage, and Hickory DNS.</li>
                  <li><strong>Edge isolates:</strong> Fast V8 isolate compute with sub-millisecond cold starts.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="brief-column">
                <h3 class="brief-col-heading">OllaNode eliminates…</h3>
                <ul class="brief-crosslist">
                  <li><strong>Per-minute metering:</strong> No encoding taxes, speech transcription meters, or egress markups.</li>
                  <li><strong>Origin leakage:</strong> Edge playback proxies rewrite URIs so your storage origin is never leaked.</li>
                  <li><strong>Proprietary silos:</strong> 100% permissive open source (Apache-2.0, zero AGPL code).</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 1: Clean Architecture -->
        <section class="wai-content-section" id="architecture">
          <h2 class="wai-section-heading">1. Clean Architecture & Rust Engine</h2>
          <p>
            Structured as a modular Cargo workspace built in <strong>Rust (Axum)</strong> with 11 library crates and 9 independently-deployable services:
          </p>
          <ul class="wai-text-list">
            <li><strong>Worker Engine:</strong> NATS JetStream by default; optional Temporal activity layer.</li>
            <li><strong>Permissive OSS:</strong> Licensed under <strong>Apache-2.0</strong> with strictly permissive dependencies.</li>
            <li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Run on any standard Linux VPS with ≥ 8 vCPU and 16 GB RAM.</li>
          </ul>

          <div class="code-curl-preview">
            <div class="curl-bar mono">POST /v1/videos</div>
            <pre class="curl-code mono"><code>$ curl -X POST https://api.ollanode.com/v1/videos \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $KEY" \
  -d '&#123;"title":"launch.mp4"&#125;'</code></pre>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 2: Product Surfaces -->
        <section class="wai-content-section" id="capabilities">
          <h2 class="wai-section-heading">2. Modular Product Surfaces Behind One REST API</h2>
          <p>
            Access video, storage, DNS, edge compute, and AI agent tooling through a unified self-hosted control plane:
          </p>

          <div class="surface-cards-grid">
            <div class="surface-card">
              <div class="surface-header">
                <span class="surface-dot"></span>
                <span class="surface-badge">Video Pipeline</span>
              </div>
              <p class="surface-desc">Adaptive HLS (360p→4K), NVENC acceleration, MP4/MP3 packaging & AES-128 encryption.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="surface-card">
              <div class="surface-header">
                <span class="surface-dot"></span>
                <span class="surface-badge">Private Playback</span>
              </div>
              <p class="surface-desc">Expiring signed tokens, origin-shield proxying, cookie-scoped CDN segments & embed player.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="surface-card">
              <div class="surface-header">
                <span class="surface-dot"></span>
                <span class="surface-badge">Thumbnails & ASR</span>
              </div>
              <p class="surface-desc">Storyboard sprites, sampled frames, and word-level Whisper transcripts with chapters.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="surface-card">
              <div class="surface-header">
                <span class="surface-dot"></span>
                <span class="surface-badge">Voice Engine</span>
              </div>
              <p class="surface-desc">Text translation, natural TTS, and speech-to-text inference with zero per-character metering.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="surface-card">
              <div class="surface-header">
                <span class="surface-dot"></span>
                <span class="surface-badge">Edge CDN</span>
              </div>
              <p class="surface-desc">Multi-tenant pull zones on OpenResty edge with instant cache purge and token signing.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="surface-card">
              <div class="surface-header">
                <span class="surface-dot"></span>
                <span class="surface-badge">Storage & Optimizer</span>
              </div>
              <p class="surface-desc">S3-compatible storage zones with presigned uploads and on-the-fly image resizing via imgproxy.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="surface-card">
              <div class="surface-header">
                <span class="surface-dot"></span>
                <span class="surface-badge">Authoritative DNS</span>
              </div>
              <p class="surface-desc">Hickory authoritative DNS serving zones and records (A/AAAA/CNAME/TXT) directly from Postgres.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="surface-card">
              <div class="surface-header">
                <span class="surface-dot"></span>
                <span class="surface-badge">Edge Functions</span>
              </div>
              <p class="surface-desc">JavaScript/TypeScript edge compute executed in lightweight V8 isolates with zero cold-start delay.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="surface-card">
              <div class="surface-header">
                <span class="surface-dot"></span>
                <span class="surface-badge">AI Governance</span>
              </div>
              <p class="surface-desc">Model Context Protocol (MCP) server, approval-gated actions, and tamper-evident audit logs.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="surface-card">
              <div class="surface-header">
                <span class="surface-dot"></span>
                <span class="surface-badge">Security & WAF</span>
              </div>
              <p class="surface-desc">Coraza + OWASP CRS WAF, origin shielding, idempotency protection, and fine-grained rate limits.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 3: Playback & Origin -->
        <section class="wai-content-section" id="playback-cdn">
          <h2 class="wai-section-heading">3. Private Origin Playback & Edge Runtime</h2>
          <p>
            <strong>Zero origin leakage:</strong> Video bytes are never served directly from storage. The playback service rewrites HLS manifest URIs so your storage bucket credentials and endpoints are never exposed.
          </p>
          <ul class="wai-text-list">
            <li><strong>Pull Zones:</strong> Routed by Host header with instantaneous cache purges.</li>
            <li><strong>Storage Zones:</strong> Standard S3-compatible endpoints with integrated image optimization.</li>
            <li><strong>DNS & Edge:</strong> Postgres-backed Hickory DNS records and zero-overhead V8 edge isolates.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 4: Ownership-First Pricing (SIDE BY SIDE ON ALL SCREENS) -->
        <section class="wai-content-section" id="pricing">
          <div class="pricing-banner-header">
            <h2 class="wai-section-heading">4. Ownership-First Pricing</h2>
            <p class="pricing-sublead">
              No per-minute fees or egress markups. You bring the compute — we bring the platform.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="wai-pricing-grid">
            <!-- Tier 1: Self-Host -->
            <div class="wai-pricing-card">
              <div class="pricing-card-badge">OPEN SOURCE</div>
              <h3 class="pricing-plan-name">Self-Host</h3>
              <p class="pricing-plan-tagline">On your hardware.</p>
              
              <div class="pricing-cost">
                <span class="cost-figure">$0</span>
                <span class="cost-unit">/ license</span>
              </div>

              <ul class="pricing-features-list">
                <li><span class="feat-check">✓</span> <span>Full source (Apache-2.0)</span></li>
                <li><span class="feat-check">✓</span> <span>Video pipeline + HLS</span></li>
                <li><span class="feat-check">✓</span> <span>Edge CDN & S3 storage</span></li>
                <li><span class="feat-check">✓</span> <span>Unlimited videos</span></li>
                <li><span class="feat-check">✓</span> <span>REST API & MCP server</span></li>
              </ul>

              <div class="pricing-card-footer">
                <a href="https://login.ollanode.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-plan btn-primary">
                  Start Free →
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Tier 2: Managed -->
            <div class="wai-pricing-card featured-plan">
              <div class="pricing-card-badge badge-accent">ENTERPRISE</div>
              <h3 class="pricing-plan-name">Managed</h3>
              <p class="pricing-plan-tagline">On your cloud.</p>
              
              <div class="pricing-cost">
                <span class="cost-figure">Custom</span>
                <span class="cost-unit">/ dedicated</span>
              </div>

              <ul class="pricing-features-list">
                <li><span class="feat-check">✓</span> <span>Everything in Self-Host</span></li>
                <li><span class="feat-check">✓</span> <span>Auto upgrades & backups</span></li>
                <li><span class="feat-check">✓</span> <span>Multi-region edge PoPs</span></li>
                <li><span class="feat-check">✓</span> <span>99.99% SLA & 24/7 support</span></li>
                <li><span class="feat-check">✓</span> <span>Dedicated engineers</span></li>
              </ul>

              <div class="pricing-card-footer">
                <a href="https://ollanode.com#contact" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-plan btn-secondary">
                  Contact Sales
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <aside class="wai-box-note">
            <p>
              <strong>Note:</strong> Both tiers use the exact same open platform — Managed simply means our team handles operations, upgrades, and uptime SLAs on your cloud infrastructure.
            </p>
          </aside>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 5: Honest Edges (FAQ) -->
        <section class="wai-content-section" id="faq">
          <h2 class="wai-section-heading">5. What It Is — And What It Isn't</h2>
          <p class="faq-subtext">Direct answers to common architecture and capability questions:</p>

          <div class="wai-faq-list">
            <div class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-question">Is there live streaming?</h3>
              <p class="faq-answer">No — OllaNode is an on-demand VOD pipeline only. There is currently no RTMP or live ingest.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-question">HLS or DASH?</h3>
              <p class="faq-answer">HLS today. Segments are formatted in CMAF/fMP4, which is DASH-ready for the upcoming manifest update.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-question">How does pricing work?</h3>
              <p class="faq-answer">The software is free and open source. There are no metering systems; your only expense is your own cloud compute and storage.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-question">What is off by default?</h3>
              <p class="faq-answer">AI diarization, NVENC hardware transcoding, and AV1 encode tiers are fully functional but config-gated and disabled by default.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-question">How is it licensed?</h3>
              <p class="faq-answer">Apache-2.0, with strictly permissive dependencies (no AGPL code) — SeaweedFS, imgproxy, tusd, and Coraza.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-question">Where is the API documented?</h3>
              <p class="faq-answer">Machine-readable OpenAPI 3.1 specification at <code>GET /openapi.json</code>, with full Model Context Protocol (MCP) server support.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Final CTA Box -->
        <div class="wai-box wai-box-next">
          <div class="wai-box-inner text-center">
            <h3>Ready to take control of your video infrastructure?</h3>
            <p>Deploy your cluster, run the API gateway, and transcode your first video in minutes.</p>
            <div class="next-btn-row">
              <a href="https://login.ollanode.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-plan btn-primary">
                Get Started Free →
              </a>
              <a href="https://ollanode.com/docs/edge-functions" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-plan btn-ghost">
                Read Documentation
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </main>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
      const links = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLAnchorElement>('.sidenav-link');
      const menu = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.sidenav-menu');
      const sections = Array.from(links)
        .map((link) => {
          const id = link.getAttribute('href')?.replace('#', '');
          return id ? document.getElementById(id) : null;
        })
        .filter((el): el is HTMLElement => el !== null);

      if (!links.length || !sections.length) return;

      function scrollLinkIntoMenuView(linkEl: HTMLElement) {
        if (!menu || window.innerWidth > 868) return;
        const linkLeft = linkEl.offsetLeft;
        const linkWidth = linkEl.offsetWidth;
        const menuWidth = menu.clientWidth;
        menu.scrollTo({
          left: linkLeft - (menuWidth / 2) + (linkWidth / 2),
          behavior: 'smooth'
        });
      }

      links.forEach((link) => {
        link.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
          const href = link.getAttribute('href');
          if (href && href.startsWith('#')) {
            const target = document.getElementById(href.slice(1));
            if (target) {
              e.preventDefault();
              target.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth' });
              links.forEach((l) => l.classList.remove('active'));
              link.classList.add('active');
              scrollLinkIntoMenuView(link);
            }
          }
        });
      });

      const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
        (entries) => {
          entries.forEach((entry) => {
            if (entry.isIntersecting) {
              const id = entry.target.id;
              links.forEach((link) => {
                const href = link.getAttribute('href')?.replace('#', '');
                if (href === id) {
                  link.classList.add('active');
                  scrollLinkIntoMenuView(link);
                } else {
                  link.classList.remove('active');
                }
              });
            }
          });
        },
        {
          rootMargin: '-80px 0px -55% 0px',
          threshold: 0.05,
        }
      );

      sections.forEach((sec) => observer.observe(sec));
    });
  </script>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* ----------------------------------------------------
     Zero-Overflow Guaranteed Layout Rules
     ---------------------------------------------------- */
  .wai-about-wrapper {
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
    width: 100% !important;
    max-width: 100% !important;
    box-sizing: border-box !important;
    overflow: visible !important;
    background: var(--bg, #f8fafc);
    color: var(--text, #0f172a);
    min-height: auto;
    padding-bottom: 1.25rem !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
  }

  :global(.site-main) {
    padding-bottom: 0 !important;
  }

  :global(.light-footer) {
    margin-top: 0 !important;
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .wai-about-wrapper {
      background: #0b0e14;
      color: #f1f5f9;
    }
  }

  .container-wide {
    width: 100% !important;
    max-width: 1140px !important;
    margin: 0 auto !important;
    padding: 0 1.25rem !important;
    box-sizing: border-box !important;
    min-width: 0 !important;
  }

  /* Breadcrumb Bar */
  .wai-breadcrumb-bar {
    background: #ffffff;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
    padding: 0.65rem 0;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    width: 100% !important;
    max-width: 100% !important;
    box-sizing: border-box !important;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .wai-breadcrumb-bar {
      background: #111622;
      border-bottom-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }
  }

  .breadcrumb-list {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    overflow-x: auto;
    white-space: nowrap;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    max-width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .breadcrumb-list::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .breadcrumb-list li a {
    color: #0284c7;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .breadcrumb-list li a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
    color: #ff6600;
  }

  .breadcrumb-list .separator {
    color: #94a3b8;
  }

  .breadcrumb-list li[aria-current="page"] {
    color: var(--text, #0f172a);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .breadcrumb-list li[aria-current="page"] {
      color: #cbd5e1;
    }
  }

  /* Target Offset for Smooth Scrolling */
  .wai-page-header,
  .wai-content-section,
  .wai-box[id] {
    scroll-margin-top: 100px;
  }

  /* 2-Column Responsive Layout */
  .wai-layout-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 240px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    width: 100% !important;
    max-width: 100% !important;
    box-sizing: border-box !important;
    min-width: 0 !important;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Left Column: Sidenav */
  .wai-sidenav-col {
    position: relative;
    height: 100%;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .wai-sidenav-sticky {
    position: -webkit-sticky;
    position: sticky;
    top: 86px;
    z-index: 30;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.15rem 0.95rem;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .wai-sidenav-sticky {
      background: #111622;
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    }
  }

  .sidenav-header {
    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .sidenav-header {
      border-bottom-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }
  }

  .sidenav-title {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text, #0f172a);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .sidenav-title {
      color: #f8fafc;
    }
  }

  .sidenav-menu {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    min-width: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .sidenav-link {
    display: block;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.65rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--muted, #475467);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 6px;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
    border-left: 2px solid transparent;
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .sidenav-link {
      color: #94a3b8;
    }
  }

  .sidenav-link:hover {
    color: #ff6600;
    background: rgba(255, 102, 0, 0.06);
  }

  .sidenav-link.active {
    color: #ff6600;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: rgba(255, 102, 0, 0.08);
    border-left-color: #ff6600;
  }

  .sidenav-cta-box {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .sidenav-cta-box {
      border-top-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }
  }

  .cta-box-title {
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text, #0f172a);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .cta-box-title {
      color: #f8fafc;
    }
  }

  .cta-box-desc {
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: var(--muted, #64748b);
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .sidenav-cta-btn {
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
    background: #ff6600;
    color: #ffffff !important;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.15s ease;
  }

  .sidenav-cta-btn:hover {
    background: #e65100;
  }

